          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi ŵatisile, jemanjajo piŵaliji mkwembeceya. Jwalakwe ŵapite kupeleta maganga gegobedwe mitembe gala ni kutilila ku Seyila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice kucilambo ca kwitumbi ca Efelemu, jwalakwe ŵagombile lipenga kwaŵilanga acalume ŵa ku Isalaeli kuti ajawule ku ngondo, kaneko ŵatulwice nawo matumbi ali mkwalongolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵasalile kuti, “Anguye une! AMBUJE ampundisye jemanja kwa amagongo ŵenu, Amowabu.” Myoyo ŵamkuyisye Ehudi acitulukaga kuja kukusumula malo gakajombwece Amowabu pa Lusulo lwa Yolodani, jemanjajo nginakunda mundu jwalijose kuti ajomboce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyele lyuŵalyo ŵawuleje asilikali ŵamacili mnope ŵa ku Mowabu ciŵandika 10,000, pangali jumo juŵatisile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyele lyuŵalyo Aisalaeli ŵapundile Amowabu, nipo wapali mtendele mcilambomo kwa yaka 80.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
